# Cline Instructions - University Lectures Template

Comprehensive guide for Cline AI when working with this Docusaurus-based university lectures template.

## Project Overview

Template for university course materials with:
- **Docusaurus 3** - Static site generator
- **React components** - Interactive UI elements
- **Reveal.js** - Slide presentations from Markdown
- **Exercise system** - Progress tracking with LocalStorage

## Project Structure

```
university-lectures-template/
├── docusaurus-site/
│   ├── docs/                     # Lecture content
│   │   ├── XX-topic-name/        # Each lecture directory
│   │   │   ├── _category_.json   # Sidebar metadata
│   │   │   ├── lecture.md        # Theory content
│   │   │   ├── exercises.md      # Practice problems
│   │   │   └── slides.md         # Reveal.js presentation (optional)
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── components/           # React components
│   │   │   ├── InfoBoxes/        # InfoBox, WarningBox, SuccessBox, WhyBox
│   │   │   ├── Exercise/         # ExerciseCard, ProgressTracker
│   │   │   ├── Grid/             # Grid, Card
│   │   │   ├── Comparison/       # ComparisonBox
│   │   │   └── ...
│   │   └── pages/                # Homepage, slides index
│   ├── plugins/
│   │   ├── lectures-plugin.js    # Loads lectures for homepage
│   │   └── reveal-slides-plugin.js # Generates Reveal.js slides
│   └── docusaurus.config.ts      # Main configuration
└── .github/workflows/deploy.yml  # GitHub Pages deployment
```

---

## Creating New Lectures - Step by Step

### Step 1: Create Directory

```bash
cd docusaurus-site/docs
mkdir XX-topic-name  # e.g., 02-arrays
```

**Naming:** `XX-topic-name` (number-hyphenated-lowercase)

### Step 2: Create _category_.json

```json
{
  "label": "XX. Topic Title",
  "position": XX,
  "collapsed": false,
  "link": {
    "type": "generated-index",
    "description": "Brief description"
  }
}
```

### Step 3: Create lecture.md

**Required Frontmatter:**
```yaml
---
title: "Лекция"
sidebar_position: 1
slug: lecture
tags: [topic, subtopic]
---
```

**Required Imports (at top, after frontmatter):**
```jsx
import InfoBox from '@site/src/components/InfoBoxes/InfoBox';
import WarningBox from '@site/src/components/InfoBoxes/WarningBox';
import SuccessBox from '@site/src/components/InfoBoxes/SuccessBox';
import WhyBox from '@site/src/components/InfoBoxes/WhyBox';
import LearningObjectives from '@site/src/components/LearningObjectives';
import QuickSummary from '@site/src/components/QuickSummary';
import CollapsibleSection from '@site/src/components/CollapsibleSection';
import ComparisonBox from '@site/src/components/Comparison/ComparisonBox';
import Grid from '@site/src/components/Grid/Grid';
import Card from '@site/src/components/Grid/Card';
import ViewSlidesButton from '@site/src/components/ViewSlidesButton';
```

**Structure:**
```markdown
# Topic Title

<ViewSlidesButton lectureSlug="topic-name" />

<QuickSummary>

**Key Points:**
- Point 1
- Point 2

</QuickSummary>

<LearningObjectives objectives={["Goal 1", "Goal 2", "Goal 3"]} />

---

## Introduction

<WhyBox title="Why?">
Motivation
</WhyBox>

## Main Content

<InfoBox title="Definition">
Core concept
</InfoBox>

\`\`\`python
# Code example
\`\`\`

<SuccessBox title="Best Practice">
Tip or recommendation
</SuccessBox>

---

## Additional Resources

### Online Materials
- [Resource](url) - Description
```

### Step 4: Create exercises.md

**🎯 CRITICAL: Zero Config - NO `id` or `exercises` props!**

**Required Imports:**
```jsx
import ExerciseCard from '@site/src/components/Exercise/ExerciseCard';
import ProgressTracker from '@site/src/components/Exercise/ProgressTracker';
import CollapsibleSection from '@site/src/components/CollapsibleSection';
```

**Structure:**
```markdown
# Exercises: Topic

<ProgressTracker />

---

## Easy Exercises

<ExerciseCard difficulty="easy">

### Task 1: Title

Problem description

<CollapsibleSection title="💡 Hint" icon="💡">
Hint content
</CollapsibleSection>

<CollapsibleSection title="✅ Solution" icon="✅">

\`\`\`python
# Solution code
\`\`\`

**Explanation:** ...

**Complexity:** $O(n)$

</CollapsibleSection>

</ExerciseCard>
```

### Step 5: Create slides.md (Optional)

```markdown
---
title: Topic Title
theme: white
highlightTheme: github
transition: slide
---

# First Slide

Content

---

# Second Slide

--

## Vertical Subslide

---

Note:
Speaker notes (press S to view)
```

After creating slides:
```bash
npm run build:slides
```

---

## Component Reference

### InfoBox Variants

```jsx
<InfoBox title="Information">Content</InfoBox>      // Blue
<SuccessBox title="Tip">Content</SuccessBox>        // Green
<WarningBox title="Warning">Content</WarningBox>    // Orange/Red
<WhyBox title="Why?">Content</WhyBox>               // Purple
```

### LearningObjectives

```jsx
<LearningObjectives objectives={[
  "First objective",
  "Second objective",
  "Third objective"
]} />
```

### QuickSummary

```jsx
<QuickSummary>

**Key Points:**
- Point 1
- Point 2

</QuickSummary>
```

### CollapsibleSection

```jsx
<CollapsibleSection title="Title" icon="🎯">
Hidden content
</CollapsibleSection>
```

**Icons:** 💡 (hint), ✅ (solution), 📚 (info), 🎯 (goal), ⚠️ (warning)

### Grid and Card

```jsx
<Grid columns={2}>
  <Card title="Card 1" icon="📊">Content 1</Card>
  <Card title="Card 2" icon="📈">Content 2</Card>
</Grid>
```

**IMPORTANT Rules:**
- Grid requires **2+ Card** components
- Each Card **MUST have** `title` prop
- For single item, use `<InfoBox>` instead

### ComparisonBox

```jsx
<ComparisonBox
  left={{
    title: "Approach A",
    content: (
      <ul>
        <li>Point 1</li>
        <li>Point 2</li>
      </ul>
    )
  }}
  right={{
    title: "Approach B",
    content: (
      <ul>
        <li>Point 1</li>
        <li>Point 2</li>
      </ul>
    )
  }}
/>
```

**Props:** `left`/`right` (neutral) or `wrong`/`correct` (with ❌/✅ icons)

### ExerciseCard

```jsx
<ExerciseCard difficulty="easy">

### Task Title

Description...

</ExerciseCard>
```

**Difficulty levels:** `easy`, `easy-medium`, `medium`, `medium-hard`, `hard`

**⚠️ DO NOT set `id` prop!** Auto-generated from title.

### ProgressTracker

```jsx
<ProgressTracker />
```

**⚠️ DO NOT set `exercises` prop!** Auto-detects ExerciseCard components.

### ViewSlidesButton

```jsx
<ViewSlidesButton lectureSlug="topic-name" />
```

